&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Remote within Europe, with regular presence in Bremen&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct Reports: &lt;/strong&gt;None initially; technical leadership across the engineering group&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Mission&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the architecture of the software platform on which Constructor Labs&#39; quantum group builds. The platform drives physical quantum hardware end to end — calibration, orchestration, experiment execution and device state — and must work both in our own cloud and on customer premises, including restricted and air-gapped environments. The Principal Architect sets the technical direction, makes the structural decisions, and is the senior engineering voice in a group where research and engineering sit closely together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pillar 1 Platform Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end architecture across backend services, job orchestration, hardware abstraction and device state management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the interfaces between the scientific layer and the platform layer so physicists can work without engineering support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make and carry the build-versus-buy and framework decisions; document them so they survive the people who made them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the migration of the platform onto the Constructor technology stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Success Metrics and KPIs: architectural decisions documented and adopted, platform stability, migration delivered to plan.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pillar 2 Hands-on Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write production code in the core of the system, not only design documents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the hardest components personally — those where correctness and performance both matter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and enforce engineering standards: testing, review, structured logging, dependency governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove single points of failure so no component has only one person who understands it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Success Metrics and KPIs: test coverage, review discipline, bus factor above one on every core component.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pillar 3 Working with Research&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work day to day with research physicists, translating experimental workflows into software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep the research and engineering collaboration model intact as the group grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the product function with realistic estimates and honest technical constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Accountability: research team able to run experiments without engineering bottlenecks.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years building production software systems, with real depth in Python, C#/.NET or C++.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Distributed systems, job scheduling, and interfacing with instruments or physical hardware.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record as the senior technical voice in a small team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivered software into on-premise and restricted environments, not only cloud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to hold an architecture in your head and explain it simply to people who are not engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable in a scientific domain. A physics degree is not required, genuine interest is.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pragmatic about trade-offs; able to ship rather than perfect.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written communication. Decisions that are not written down do not exist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education &amp;amp; Languages&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in computer science, physics, engineering or equivalent practical track record.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English. German useful, not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What This Role Is (and Is Not)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role IS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deeply hands-on, with real authority over technical direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Central to everything the quantum group builds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A role where you will have peers and a platform behind you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is NOT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A management track role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An architecture-committee or advisory position.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A role where someone else writes the hard code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>
